{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36662","headline":"逼试投所知 · 罗隐","name":"逼试投所知","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"桃在仙翁旧苑傍，暖烟轻霭扑人香。\n十年此地频偷眼，二月春风最断肠。\n曾恨梦中无好事，也知囊里有仙方。\n寻思仙骨终难得，始与回头问玉皇。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36662.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36662","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}